* Measurement
*meas dc Vgsp_at_Vcm when vout=Vcm
*print Vgsp_at_Vcm

* Write Data
*unset appendwrite
*set wr_vecnames
*set wr_singlescale
*wrdata ../plot_simulations/data/tb_v-to-i_dc.txt v(vin) v(vout)

*quit
.endc



